---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About Haitu Technology | Sausage Casing Supply Solutions"
  description="Haitu Technology supplies plastic, collagen, cellulose and fibrous sausage casings, with product customization, technical coordination and international supply support."
>
  <section class="page-intro catalog-page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Haitu Technology</p>
    <h1>About Us</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="about-pillars" aria-label="Haitu's strengths">
    <article class="pillar">
      <div class="pillar-copy">
        <p class="pillar-kicker">01 / PRODUCTION & SUPPLY</p>
        <h2>Manufacturing Facilities You Can Rely On</h2>
        <p>
          We offer customized production tailored to your needs, 
          meeting customer requirements in specifications, diameter, 
          shirring, multi-color printing, and closed end.  
        </p>
        <p>
          Our team is highly professional, helping clients clarify product details 
          before ordering and ensuring efficient collaboration throughout the entire 
          production and delivery process for stable and timely fulfillment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/images/about-factory-outside.jpg"
        alt="Production facilities supporting sausage casing supply"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>

    <article class="pillar pillar-reverse">
      <div class="pillar-copy">
        <p class="pillar-kicker">02 / PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT</p>
        <h2>Product Options for Different Processing Needs</h2>
        <p>
          Different sausages require different casing properties. Our plastic
          casing range includes smoke-permeable, high-barrier, matte-finish and
          printed options for different product types and visual requirements.
          Printing can be coordinated for designs of up to 12 colours.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work with production partners to discuss application requirements
          and explore suitable solutions. New products are evaluated carefully,
          and development-stage products are distinguished from established
          commercial offerings.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/images/about-sausage.jpg"
        alt="Equipment used in casing production and processing"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>

    <article class="pillar">
      <div class="pillar-copy">
        <p class="pillar-kicker">03 / CUSTOMER & TECHNICAL SUPPORT</p>
        <h2>Practical Support from Inquiry to Production</h2>
        <p>
          Choosing a casing involves more than price and caliber. We help
          customers clarify product type, dimensions, printing, packaging and
          processing conditions before confirming an order.
        </p>
        <p>
          When application questions arise, we coordinate with the relevant
          production partners to follow up on product selection and technical
          requirements. Our aim is to make communication clearer and help
          customers assess suitable options with greater confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/images/about-equipment.jpg"
        alt="Sausage products made with smoke-permeable casing"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>

    <article class="pillar pillar-reverse">
      <div class="pillar-copy">
        <p class="pillar-kicker">04 / INTERNATIONAL TRADE</p>
        <h2>One Contact for Multiple Casing Requirements</h2>
        <p>
          Based in Qingdao, China, Haitu serves customers in Russia, Central
          Asia, North America and other markets. Our product portfolio covers
          plastic, collagen, cellulose and fibrous casings, helping distributors
          and manufacturers coordinate multiple casing requirements through
          one point of contact.
        </p>
        <p>
          From quotations and order confirmation to production follow-up,
          export documentation and shipment coordination, we work to keep
          information clear and the supply process organized.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/en/contact-us/">
          Discuss Your Requirements <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/images/about-logistics.jpg"
        alt="Casing products prepared for international shipment"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="about-cta">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">LET'S WORK TOGETHER</p>
      <h2>Looking for the Right Casing for Your Business?</h2>
      <p>
        Tell us about your sausage products, required specifications, processing
        conditions or distribution market. We will help you review the
        requirements and discuss suitable supply options.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-red" href="/en/contact-us/">
      Contact Haitu <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .page-intro {
  max-width: none;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.catalog-page-intro {
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgb(255 250 246 / 92%) 0%,
      rgb(255 250 246 / 75%) 45%,
      rgb(255 250 246 / 15%) 100%
    ),
    url('/images/about-factory.jpg');

  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;

  padding: 56px clamp(22px, 13.15vw, 176px);
  border-radius: 10px;
}
  

  .page-intro h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .page-intro > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-pillars {
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 6vw, 92px) 34px;
  }

  .pillar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(280px, 0.92fr);
    gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 68px);
    align-items: center;
    padding: 42px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .pillar-reverse .pillar-copy {
    order: 2;
  }

  .pillar-reverse > img {
    order: 1;
  }

  .pillar > img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(280px, 28vw, 380px);
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 6px 46px 6px 6px;
    background: #fff5ec;
  }

  .pillar-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 11px;
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .pillar h2 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.14;
    letter-spacing: -0.55px;
  }

  .pillar-copy p:not(.pillar-kicker) {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .pillar-copy .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }

  .about-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    margin: 8px clamp(24px, 6vw, 92px) 60px;
    padding: 32px clamp(22px, 3vw, 40px);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff5ec;
  }

  .about-cta > div {
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .about-cta h2 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 33px);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .about-cta p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-cta .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .pillar {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(240px, 0.9fr);
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .pillar > img {
      height: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .page-intro {
      padding: 40px 22px 30px;
    }

    .page-intro h1 {
      font-size: clamp(31px, 8vw, 40px);
    }

    .page-intro > p:not(.eyebrow) {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .about-pillars {
      padding: 0 22px 20px;
    }

    .pillar {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .pillar-reverse .pillar-copy,
    .pillar-reverse > img {
      order: initial;
    }

    .pillar > img {
      height: clamp(230px, 65vw, 340px);
      border-top-right-radius: 34px;
    }

    .pillar h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .pillar-copy p:not(.pillar-kicker) {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-cta {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin: 8px 22px 38px;
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pillar > img {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>